### 3. Specific Deductions You Mentioned
*   **Student Loan Interest ($4,800):** The IRS caps the student loan interest deduction at **$2,500** per year. Furthermore, for 2023, this deduction phases out for single filers with a Modified Adjusted Gross Income (MAGI) between $75,000 and $90,000. Because your total income (minus your Schedule C deductions) will likely land abo

  Chunk 9/13 (512 chars):
