*   **Unreimbursed Expenses ($780):** If these are expenses related to your W-2 job at Metro Consulting, **you cannot deduct them**. The Tax Cuts and Jobs Act (TCJA) eliminated miscellaneous itemized deductions for W-2 employees through 2025. (If these were for your freelance web design business, you *could* deduct them on Schedule C).
*   **Northwest Harvest Donation ($800):** Charitable contributions are only deduct

  Chunk 10/13 (512 chars):
