### 6. Portland / Oregon Specifics
Don't forget your local tax obligations!
*   **Oregon State Return (Form OR-40):** You will file your state taxes here.
*   **City of Portland / Multnomah County Business Taxes:** Because you have freelance income in Portland, you are required to file a combi

